sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant R as AccountController
    participant U as Deposit/Withdraw/TransferUseCaseImpl
    participant P as AccountPersistencePort
    participant MP as MovementClientPort
    participant W as MovementWebClientAdapter
    participant TS as transaction-service
    participant M as MongoDB

    C->>R: POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/deposits
    R->>U: execute(id, amount)
    U->>P: findById(id)
    P->>M: findById
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Account
    U->>U: account.deposit(amount)  (o withdraw/transfer)
    U->>P: save(account)
    P->>M: save
    M-->>P: document
    P-->>U: Account
    U->>MP: recordMovement(...)
    MP->>W: POST http://transaction-service/api/v1/movements
    W->>TS: (vía Eureka, circuit breaker)
    TS-->>W: 201
    W-->>MP: ok
    MP-->>U: ok
    U-->>R: Account (balance actualizado)
    R-->>C: 200 OK
    Note over U: Retiro: comisión si excede maxMonthlyTransactions.<br/>Error InsufficientBalanceException si no hay saldo.
